		{
			"id": "nUVG7Nw6ti-VZb36H",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 8, DX 13, IQ 3, HT 11, HP 8, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 11, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
