		{
			"id": "ndbmNZ3z_6Hm2ACYv",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 28 (offense 29, protection -1), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvLP6_ol0HJ5uzOwr",
			"text": "Swarming Bites: No attack roll and no active defense. Swarming Bites: 1d-1 impaling, Reach C. No attack roll and no defense. Roll HT at a penalty for the sheer number of doses; failure means the limb goes, then the breathing does. This is the most lethal thing any of these swarms does, and it is entirely chemical."
		},
